{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgmkYGsN1zewsAhoNX9wt","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## 1. What I'd do and how sure I am\n\nI'd keep about a month or two of spending in my current account (עו\"ש) and move the rest of my savings out. The page points me to a \"קרן כספית\" (a money market fund) as the closest thing that still lets me get my money quickly. I'd also check whether my bank is one of the few that pay interest on the balance.\n\nI'm about 75% sure that leaving it all there loses me money. The page made that very clear: \"אחרי 10 שנים, ₪10,000 בעו\"ש שווים ₪8,203 בכסף של היום. ₪1,797 פחות.\" It hit me harder than I expected.\n\nI'm only about 40% sure about the next step. I don't know what a קרן כספית really is, how to buy one, or if it's safe. The page also says its 3.25% is \"הנחה של האתר, לא הבטחה ולא תחזית\", so I'm not sure what I'd actually get.\n\n## 2. Parts I actually used\n\n- The title and the grey line under it: \"כסף שיושב בו לא תמיד מקבל ריבית\"\n- \"למה משתמשים בזה\", especially the line saying money left in the account for a whole quarter \"מעבר לסף שבחוק כבר שייך במקום אחר\"\n- The calculator box \"כמה עולה להשאיר כסף בעו\"ש?\", where I'd put in my own amount, plus its yellow/teal chart\n- \"המחיר של להשאיר ₪2,576\" and the text under it about 2% price rises\n- \"שווה לדעת\", the line \"4 מתוך 8 הבנקים... הכי הרבה: 3%, אצל דיסקונט\"\n- The start of \"סיכונים ומה לא מוגן\": \"אין בישראל ביטוח פיקדונות\"\n\n## 3. Block by block\n\n- **Top bar and pill tabs (מה זה / למה משתמשים בזה / מה מייחד / שווה לדעת):** Skimmed. I didn't tap them; I just scrolled.\n- **Legend \"123 ממקור / 123 מחושב / 123 הזנתם\":** Confused me and I skipped it. I didn't understand why there are three kinds of numbers.\n- **\"מה זה\":** Skimmed it. I already know what a current account is. The ₪15,000 line caught my eye (\"נשארת מעל ₪15,000 רבעון שלם, הבנק חייב לשלוח לכם הודעה\"), because I might be over that and never got a message. The bit about fee plans and \"BANK-35\" lost me.\n- **\"למה משתמשים בזה\":** Used it. It's short and tells me the account is for this month's spending. The comparison \"מול קרן כספית יומית העו\"ש עדיף רק כשצריך את הכסף באותו יום\" was useful. I didn't get the \"מזומן שקלי\" button.\n- **\"מה מייחד\", the calculator:** Used it the most (see question 4).\n- **The 0% check: \"חלק מהבנקים כן משלמים ריבית, בתנאים ועל סכום קטן בלבד\":** I didn't open it, but the headline alone told me something.\n- **Second calculator, \"מה קורה לכסף לאורך זמן\" (₪10,000 + ₪500 a month):** Skimmed it and got a bit confused. It shows ₪62,681 against ₪70,000 put in. I understood that I'd lose about ₪7,000, but I'm not putting in ₪500 a month, and I wasn't sure how it relates to the first calculator. \"הצגה כטבלה\": skipped.\n- **\"שווה לדעת\":** Used the 4-out-of-8 banks line. I skipped the \"BANK-15\" line about money market products.\n- **\"מי מציע ומי מפקח\":** Skimmed. The bank can't refuse to open an account. Fine, but not my question.\n- **\"כסף נכנס ויוצא\":** Skimmed. \"בכל עת\" is reassuring. The part about moving to another bank was interesting but it got cut off.\n- **\"כמה זה עולה\":** Skimmed. \"לפי התעריפון של הגורם המציע\" tells me nothing.\n- **\"מיסוי\":** Mostly skipped. I got \"מס על הריבית כשהיא נזקפת\". The red box (\"הפטור למעוטי הכנסה... TXI OQ11\") confused me completely.\n- **Paragraph about loss from selling securities:** Skipped. I have no idea what it means.\n- **\"סיכונים ומה לא מוגן\":** Read the first line and it scared me a little: \"אין בישראל ביטוח פיקדונות\". The rest is about laws and committees, so I skimmed it.\n- **\"פטורים לפי גיל ושימוש\" (locked) and \"הצגת כל הבדיקות\":** Skipped and confused. I don't know what \"חסום\" means here.\n- **\"מונחים\" glossary:** Skimmed. \"ריבית על יתרת זכות\" was helpful, but by then I'd already worked it out.\n- **Footer links:** Skipped. \"השוואה למטרה\" maybe, later.\n\n## 4. Lists, tables and charts\n\n**First chart (the triangle):**\n- I looked at the teal line going down (בעו\"ש), the yellow line going up (בקרן כספית), and the brown filled area with the label \"המחיר של להשאיר ₪2,576\". The shape made the point instantly.\n- I looked at the dashed line only to see \"the amount I started with\".\n- I ignored the y-axis numbers (7–12 thousand) and the note \"הציר האנכי לא מתחיל באפס\". I didn't understand why it was there.\n- I moved the years slider in my head and ignored the x-axis ticks except \"היום\" and \"10\".\n- I was confused by two different numbers: ₪1,797 above the chart and ₪2,576 inside it. It took me a while to see that one is \"how much I lose\" and the other is \"lose plus what the fund would have earned\".\n\n**Second chart:**\n- I looked at the \"נשאר לכם\" teal area and the two numbers at the bottom (62,681 / 70,000).\n- I ignored the grey \"ההפקדות שלכם\" line apart from noticing it's above the teal. I didn't open the table.\n\n## 5. What I didn't understand\n\n- What a \"קרן כספית\" actually is. Is it the bank, an app, the stock market?\n- What \"בכסף של היום\" means exactly. I guessed it's about prices going up.\n- The tags \"BANK-35\", \"BANK-15\", \"TXI OQ11\", \"TXI-17\", and the \"123\" colour legend\n- \"נזקפת\", \"רווח הון\", \"מסלול בסיסי/מורחב\", \"הטבה\"\n- \"חסום: פטורים לפי גיל ושימוש\". Blocked for whom?\n- Why there are two different \"cost\" numbers\n\n## 6. What I wanted and couldn't find\n\n- How to actually move my money into a קרן כספית: where, which one, and what it costs me\n- Whether a קרן כספית is safe, or whether I can lose money in it, especially after reading there's no deposit insurance\n- Whether *my* bank pays interest. \"לטבלה\" maybe leads there, but I only saw Discount's 3%.\n- How much I should leave in the current account, with a number or rule of thumb\n- Anything about the S&P 500, which is what everyone tells me to do. Is that the \"real\" alternative or a different thing?\n\n## 7. If half the page had to go\n\nI'd cut these first: the tax section with the red box and the securities-loss paragraph, the locked \"פטורים\" checks, the legal parts of the risks section (manager, government guarantee, the 12-month law), \"מי מציע ומי מפקח\", \"כמה זה עולה\", the glossary, the second ₪500/month calculator, and the \"123\" legend.\n\nI'd keep the title line, \"למה משתמשים בזה\", the first calculator with its chart, the \"4 מתוך 8 בנקים\" line, and the single sentence \"אין בישראל ביטוח פיקדונות\"."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":9069,"cache_read_input_tokens":14566,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":9069},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"66f0c0ec-c170-4eba-ae34-21a038043631","uuid":"12795152-812d-4249-ad49-c4fc7024259d","timestamp":"2026-11-06T13:27:29.942Z","request_id":"req_011CgmkYGczRXrDJxDfejmU3"}
